TI  - Spoken-Digit Recognition Without Training: Geometry, Coupling, and Drive Effects in Frozen Oscillator Fields
PY  - 2026
UR  - https://github.com/ekryski/oscillator-research/blob/main/papers/02-untrained-reservoirs/
